# Meeting recordings and transcripts — local only. This repo is PUBLIC, and a
# verbatim recording of colleagues is not ours to publish; git history would
# make it permanent even if deleted later. Keep the source next to the work and
# publish only the analysis drawn from it (see topic-types-inventory.md §8).
*.vtt
*.srt
*.mp4
